tion":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-22716","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/585574/1ca78bff62ae5de1b9164a8d3713de6d/720p","season":1,"ordinal":24}},{"id":"kodik-610","dubId":"610","label":"AniLibria.TV","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-5884","translationId":"610","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/157725/77207a5b52b66d9d9d5dac95c2a218a3/720p","season":1,"ordinal":24}}],"season":1,"ordinal":24},{"number":25,"audio":[{"id":"anilibria","dubId":"AniLibria","label":"AniLibria (RU)","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":1532,"sources":[{"quality":720,"url":"https://cache-rfn.libria.fun/videos/media/ts/644/25/720/01282e81c3c4c3e1f672f9fb0cb36c93.m3u8?countryIso=KZ&isAuthorized=0&isWithVideoAds=1&isWithVideoAdsAlways=1","stream":true},{"quality":480,"url":"https://cache-rfn.libria.fun/videos/media/ts/644/25/480/e3760aaf4bd0f4f0fe64b4bab2399ddc.m3u8?countryIso=KZ&isAuthorized=0&isWithVideoAds=1&isWithVideoAdsAlways=1","stream":true}],"subtitles":[],"opening":{"start":1,"end":104},"ending":{"absent":true}}],"season":1,"ordinal":25}],"translations":{"en":["Shakugan no Shana","He had thought his normal days would last forever, until they were ended abruptly by an encounter with a girl with red hair and eyes. He named her Shana.\n\n\nNot long after he enters high school, Sakai Yuji&rsquo;s normal days come to an end. He sees something bizarre on his way home: people are frozen in a strange fire, and a monster that looks like a large doll is attacking them. Just when he's about to be killed, a girl in a dark cloak wielding a large sword appears, and slices the monster in half. Although Yuji survives the strange encounter, the girl informs him of a desolate truth: \" 'You' don't exist anymore.\"\n\n\nShe calls herself a Flame Haze who hunts \"Guze no Tomogara\"; intruders from another world. She explains to him that he is a \"Torch\", a substitute of Yuji whose &ldquo;existence&rdquo; has already been devoured. She also told him that he is a special Torch, \"Mystes\", which contains a precious item in it. When he looks at his chest, he sees within himself a faint flame, just as she said.\n\n\nIt is in this way that his eternal struggle alongside the girl begins. \n\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)"],"ja":["灼眼のシャナ",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-39591":"2021-12-27T09:27:19Z","serial-22716":"2020-02-12T12:22:53Z","serial-5884":"2019-11-25T15:16:13Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-39591","serial-22716","serial-5884"],"relatedMalIds":[2787],"availableEpisodeCount":25,"rating":7.43,"relations":[{"id":2787,"relation":"sequel"}]}]}